281	     * {@code AUDIT} logger. A fresh {@link #AUDIT_SEQ monotonic sequence} is stamped onto the event so
282	     * the order of creates is recoverable from the audit stream. The event carries the owner's primary
283	     * identifier, its unified memberId.
